Z||000061||starfighter007@msn.com||05-29-2001||02:27 PM||||well I guess your dad the ford man still has some wisdom about automotive things because I recall that he thought it was fuel related I hope he will show a little more enthusiasim  to your little baby .with a little bit of automotive knowledge  these cars  are acttually fun to work on .and the sense of accomplishment when you fix something your self.I had a feeling that it could be something simple but goshhhh thats really simple.I am so very happy for I know what I t feels like To be in the middle of a procect by your self and feel helpless.Believe me when I tell you this one of the happiest days of my 40 years on this earth was when I accidently found this form I look forward to every chance I get to sign on here and read all the post. and where did you this person A C D He is a good willed human being that NEEDS to be here on this forum.well congratulations and good luck with your baby||||reg||10
